  "instructions": [
    "Warm the cooked rice in a covered microwave-safe bowl for 2 minutes, or until steaming hot. Stir in the lemon zest and keep covered.",
    "Pat the shrimp dry with paper towels. Toss them with the salt, pepper, and smoked paprika.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a 12-inch skillet over medium heat. Add the garlic and red pepper flakes and cook for 1 minute, until the garlic is fragrant and just pale gold.",
    "Raise the heat to medium-high and add the shrimp in a single layer. Cook for 2 minutes without moving them, until the undersides turn pink.",
    "Flip the shrimp and cook for 1 to 2 minutes more, until they are pink and opaque and curl into a loose C shape.",
    "Pour in the white wine and cook for 1 minute, scraping up any browned bits, until the sauce is slightly reduced.",
    "Remove the skillet from the heat. Squeeze in the juice of 2 lemon wedges and stir in the parsley.",
    "Divide the rice among four plates and spoon the shrimp and garlic oil over the top. Serve with the remaining lemon wedges."
  ],
